{"chapter_title":"The Watch","clock":"16:20","fixture":{"beat":3,"beat_id":"light","chapter":1,"in_beat":false,"kind":"beat","path":"door_open"},"sim":{"assist":false,"battery":0.760333333333333,"bearing":0.921533845053005,"brk_lights":true,"brk_radar":true,"charge_on":true,"clock_min":980.0,"clock_rate":0.0,"dark_seconds":0.0,"faults":[],"fuel":45.9266666666667,"fuel_valve":true,"gen":2,"gen_overheated":false,"gen_temp":18.2487466666667,"intensity":1,"jam_back":0.0,"jam_reengage":1,"jammed":false,"lost":0,"main_breaker":true,"mode":1,"next_id":1,"saved":0,"score":0,"seed":11,"ships":[],"storm":0.12,"storm_override":0.12,"story_jam":false,"story_mode":true,"t":2.23333333333334},"station":{"door_open":false,"visitor":false},"story":{"beat":3,"chapter":1,"clues":[],"convs_done":["ch1_dusk","ch1_gen","ch1_charging","ch1_carrier"],"duties":{"light":{"done":["mode","lamp"],"dropped":[],"known":["mode","lamp"],"s":3},"power":{"done":["fuel","engine","charge"],"dropped":["torch"],"known":["torch","engine","fuel","charge"],"s":3}},"flags":{"charge_on_once":1,"gen_started":1},"focus_duty":"light","history":[{"chapter":1,"clock":"16:20","conv":"ch1_dusk","look":"thought","mode":"thought","name":"","speaker":"","text":"Sixteen-twenty. The sun's gone behind Pabbay and taken the colour with it."},{"chapter":1,"clock":"16:20","conv":"ch1_dusk","look":"thought","mode":"thought","name":"","speaker":"","text":"Dark as a press up here. The cells are flat again. The engineer's been saying since Easter they're tired."},{"chapter":1,"clock":"16:20","conv":"ch1_dusk","look":"thought","mode":"thought","name":"","speaker":"","text":"Sunday the fourteenth of November. I wrote the date at the top of the page this morning and sat looking at it."},{"chapter":1,"clock":"16:20","conv":"ch1_dusk","look":"thought","mode":"thought","name":"","speaker":"","text":"Twenty-one winters on the lights, and the wind still sounds like someone trying the door."},{"chapter":1,"clock":"16:20","conv":"ch1_dusk","look":"thought","mode":"thought","name":"","speaker":"","text":"The phone's been dead since the September gale. The radio's all the company there is till Thursday."},{"chapter":1,"clock":"16:20","conv":"ch1_dusk","look":"thought","mode":"thought","name":"","speaker":"","text":"The torch first, top shelf by the door. Then the engine, and the lights. Then lighting-up time, and the long quiet."},{"chapter":1,"clock":"16:20","conv":"ch1_gen","look":"thought","mode":"thought","name":"","speaker":"","text":"She catches on the second turn and settles into that low knock you feel through your boots."},{"chapter":1,"clock":"16:20","conv":"ch1_charging","look":"thought","mode":"thought","name":"","speaker":"","text":"The lamps come up. That's better."},{"chapter":1,"clock":"16:20","conv":"ch1_charging","look":"thought","mode":"thought","name":"","speaker":"","text":"Fourteen amps and climbing. She'll come up."},{"chapter":1,"clock":"16:20","conv":"ch1_charging","look":"thought","mode":"thought","name":"","speaker":"","text":"Mind the temperature. That engine was old when Father was keeper."},{"chapter":1,"clock":"16:20","conv":"ch1_charging","look":"thought","mode":"thought","name":"","speaker":"","text":"Now, lighting-up time. The console, under the east window."},{"chapter":1,"clock":"16:20","conv":"ch1_carrier","look":"sound","mode":"thought","name":"","speaker":"","text":"[A carrier on Channel 16. Two clicks. No voice.]"},{"chapter":1,"clock":"16:20","conv":"ch1_carrier","look":"thought","mode":"thought","name":"","speaker":"","text":"Somebody keyed a set on sixteen. Twice. Nobody spoke."},{"chapter":1,"clock":"16:20","conv":"ch1_carrier","look":"thought","mode":"thought","name":"","speaker":"","text":"Some boy with his father's handset. On the Sabbath. His mother'll skelp him."}],"in_beat":false,"layout":3,"log_written":["log_1622","log_1640"],"obj_done":[],"objective":"","play_seconds":2.376711,"rel":{"elspeth":0,"morag":0,"ross":0},"rescues":{},"resume":[]},"version":1}